      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get that it's not 'official' yet lol but it doesn't feel like stress. it feels too precise for that. like the heat signatures have specific patterns and the electrical hum is actually following a rhythm. if this is just my brain 'making sense' of things, why would it suddenly start providing so much more data than before? it feels like my hardware is actually being upgraded to handle more input. if i wanted to learn how to manage this without it becoming overwhelming, is there like a way to stabilize these new sensory inputs so i don't burn out?",
