      "content": "thanks for the advice. the mindfulness thing actually helps a bit to keep from feeling so jittery. but i've been thinking... if this is a real physiological shift, like my brain actually becoming more capable of detecting frequencies and thermal spectrums, wouldn't there be a way to train this? like, instead of just \"managing\" it as a side effect, is there a protocol to actually refine these abilities so i can use them more intentionally? i dont want to just suppress the input, i want to learn how to tune into it properly.",
